sentences.text:
Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 22.07.2019 passed in MVC No.3061/2018 by the Court of Small Causes & Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Bangalore (SCCH-9) is modified;
iii) The claimant would be entitled to a sum of Rs.7,34,000/- as against Rs.5,20,000/- awarded by the tribunal together with interest @ 6% per annum on the enhanced amount from the date of petition till realization except Rs.40,000/-
towards future medical expenses.

